<title>CROATIA: Croatian GDP falls in Q1, higher on annual basis.</title>
<headline>Croatian GDP falls in Q1, higher on annual basis.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (GDP)    Q1 97	Q4 96	Q1 96</p>
<p> Total (000 HRK)		   49,992.0   51,809.7   48,463.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		    72.4	 75.0	 70.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Croatia's GDP rose 0.8 percent in 1994 for the first time since shrinking more than 30 percent as a result of war and breakup of former Yugoslavia in 1991. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-14557075</p>
</text>
